        "nodeType": "GeneretiTextureNoise",
        "part": "node",
        "ref": "98b45994-19f7-44f8-83a0-4202b996cead"
      },
      "text": "1D is a varying stripe; 2D is a plane. In 3D, time moves through depth. In 4D, z selects a volume slice and time has its own axis. Set speed to zero to hold the field.",
      "title": "Choose dimensionality"
    },
    {
      "actions": [
        {
          "kind": "set-widget",
          "target": {
            "nodeType": "GeneretiTextureExpression",
            "part": "node",
