          "value": "0.5+0.5*perlin(x*8,y*8,t*.2+c*2)"
        }
      ],
      "hint": "Use x/y for spatial coordinates, t for evolution and c to offset RGB channels. This panel shows 3D Perlin.",
      "target": {
        "nodeType": "GeneretiTextureExpression",
        "part": "node",
        "ref": "b0e6dd67-2ed4-4f56-99e8-3536c6eba547"
      },
      "text": "noise is an alias for perlin. perlin, simplex and value accept 1–4 coordinates and return signed values. Map to display range with 0.5+0.5*noise(...). CHOP expressions share these functions.",
      "title": "Write a noise expression"
    },
